/**
	Returns the number of times per second that `SYSTEM_PERFORMANCE_COUNTER` increases.
	const uint64 SYSTEM_PERFORMANCE_FREQUENCY;
	## Remarks:
		Divide a difference between two readings of `SYSTEM_PERFORMANCE_COUNTER` by this value to convert it to seconds. The frequency depends on the system, but it does not change while the program is running.
*/

// Example:
void main() {
	alert("Example", "The performance counter increases " + SYSTEM_PERFORMANCE_FREQUENCY + " times per second.");
}
